      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be merciful unto me, O God: for man would swallow me up; he fighting daily oppresseth me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Mine enemies would daily swallow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " up: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " many that fight against me, O thou most High.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What time I am afraid, I will trust in thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In God I will praise his word, in God I have put my trust; I will not fear what flesh can do unto me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every day they wrest my words: all their thoughts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against me for evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gather themselves together, they hide themselves, they mark my steps, when they wait for my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall they escape by iniquity? in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thine",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " anger cast down the people, O God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou tellest my wanderings: put thou my tears into thy bottle: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are they",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not in thy book?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I cry ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "unto thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", then shall mine enemies turn back: this I know; for God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "KJV1769:PSA.56.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In God will I praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " word: in the LORD will I praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
